[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5640.95, "timestamp": "01:34:00", "text": "人生があなたを今のあなたにしたのです。そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5643.91, "timestamp": "01:34:03", "text": "あなたが今のあなたであるという事実は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5647.03, "timestamp": "01:34:07", "text": "私があなたと一緒にここにいる理由。違う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5649.35, "timestamp": "01:34:09", "text": "それは本当ですか？はい。だから謝る必要はない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5651.03, "timestamp": "01:34:11", "text": "ありのままのあなたでいてくれて本当に"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5652.749, "timestamp": "01:34:12", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "as falcon said once in an interview"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5653.189, "timestamp": "01:34:13", "text": "ありのままの自分を大切にしよう。なぜ私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5655.43, "timestamp": "01:34:15", "text": "もしあなたが私を傷つけるなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5656.95, "timestamp": "01:34:16", "text": "自分のために謝罪する？それは私を傷つける"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5659.35, "timestamp": "01:34:19", "text": "だって、君のことを大切に思っているってことは分かってるでしょ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5660.709, "timestamp": "01:34:20", "text": "そして私は何も変えたくない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5662.47, "timestamp": "01:34:22", "text": "あなたについて。そういうこと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5666.149, "timestamp": "01:34:26", "text": "知る。こんにちは。分かりましたか？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5669.236, "timestamp": "01:34:29", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "when be became cinderella"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5669.75, "timestamp": "01:34:29", "text": "はい、明らかです。はい。だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5671.91, "timestamp": "01:34:31", "text": "ありのままの自分でいることを謝ってください。もし誰かが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5673.43, "timestamp": "01:34:33", "text": "謝罪するように言われる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5676.47, "timestamp": "01:34:36", "text": "自分自身で、ほら、あいつらのことなんかどうでもいいんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5677.629, "timestamp": "01:34:37", "text": "くそったれ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5679.231, "timestamp": "01:34:39", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "he*"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5680.87, "timestamp": "01:34:40", "text": "なぜなら、これが私の考えだと思うからです。あなた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5682.55, "timestamp": "01:34:42", "text": "あなたが今のようになったのは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5684.229, "timestamp": "01:34:44", "text": "人生経験、つまり"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5686.07, "timestamp": "01:34:46", "text": "人生って、あらゆることのせいだよね？そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5688.07, "timestamp": "01:34:48", "text": "もちろん、簡単なことではない。簡単ではない、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5690.47, "timestamp": "01:34:50", "text": "そう、ここまで来るには、そうですよね？そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5692.55, "timestamp": "01:34:52", "text": "あなたはどうにかここまでたどり着いた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5694.95, "timestamp": "01:34:54", "text": "ポイントを指摘すると、誰かがやって来て"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5696.709, "timestamp": "01:34:56", "text": "君のことなんて全然知らないよね？その後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5698.55, "timestamp": "01:34:58", "text": "彼らはこう言うんだ、「あのねえ、知ってる？」いいえ、変更"}]